From: Droidloom <droidloom@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] wm: always expose host system bars in Droidloom app windows

Baseline: frameworks/base 94b4c163b7dfe5ce3607f7bb8456f9573f7de57d.

Freeform policy strips system bar sources and Android apps cannot otherwise
observe the host bars. Add per-app sources after policy and to WindowMetrics,
without Android bar windows or control leashes. The read-only Droidloom
product marker confines this to Droidloom cells.

